uluscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af0M5Pm579lAJrvzG0EUPmd8vG1hHwx93FnXm-7AULElKw&oe=69F1ED94"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover-2.png", "id": "1313132757323567", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_1313132763990233_8517341453773247130_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e4plTBZaWfYQ7kNvwH_oFWK&_nc_oc=AdrJ65tnCwvQOL3iFxEPD3ZMFnIOTBPcQTPa5UByaqzazuDHQsaUS2i10IE7lWj_s3g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2jntnO7xOWVkjDzHhadnozJ8qMLsdWpetWfSqb4ZJs2A&oe=69F216EC"}, "display_name": "Spira: Paint with Fingers!", "keywords": ["paint", "draw", "create", "cake", "color"], "long_description": "**Spira \u2014 Playful 3D drawing, wherever you are!** \ud83c\udf66\n\nBring 3D creations to life with intuitive hand controls. Pick from a library of charming templates\u2014cupcakes, cozy room, characters\u2014and enjoy creativity, anywhere you are. Spira is travel mode compatible on trains and airplanes! \u2708\ufe0f\n\n{2403735053455340}\n\n**Designed for Hands** \ud83d\udc4c\n\nUse your hands to draw & paint models! Intuitive gestures make the app instant to pick up and get going. \n\n{4318315151769762}\n\n**Tasty color palettes and patterns!** \ud83c\udfa8\n\nSpira comes with ready-made color palettes, patterns and a metallic / matte \nselection.\n\n{930330233088478}\n\n**Draw & color anywhere** \u2708\ufe0f\n\nWorks with travel mode on trains and planes.\n\n{4005458899751620}", "short_description": "Spira is playful 3D painting & drawing app for mixed reality, designed to also work with travel mode! \ud83d\ude85\u2708\ufe0f\ud83d\ude97\n\nDraw and paint on 3D objects using hand-tracking, expressive brushes, and intuitive gestures. Everything happens on a turntable, so you can paint comfortably while seated \u2014 at home, in a hotel, or even on planes and trains while travelling."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://trimensio.com/spira/privacy", "